{"title": "Arthur Fery's Wimbledon Run Surprises Many", "summary": "Arthur Fery, a British wild card, has made an impressive run at Wimbledon, defeating several seeded players. His journey is being closely followed by tennis fans and pundits alike. The tournament continues with the semifinals underway.", "summary_points": ["Fery, a wildcard entry, has defeated second seed Zverev in the quarterfinals.", "He will face Zverev again in the semifinals, as well as Fery's opponent in the previous round, Noskova.", "The tournament has seen several upsets, with Fery being one of the most surprising winners.", "Fery's success has drawn attention from tennis fans and pundits worldwide.", "The Wimbledon tournament continues with the semifinals underway."], "title_hi": "अर्थर फेरी का विम्बलडन रन सुरप्राइज करता है", "summary_hi": "अर्थर फेरी, एक ब्रिटिश वाइल्डकार्ड, ने विम्बलडन में एक आश्चर्यकारी दौड़ बनाई है, कई बीजित खिलाड़ियों को हराकर। उनका यात्रा पूर्वकाल दुनिया भर के टेनिस प्रशंसकों और विश्लेषकों के ध्यान में है। टूर्नामेंट आगे चल रहे सेमीफाइनल्स के साथ जारी है.", "summary_points_hi": ["फेरी, एक वाइल्डकार्ड प्रवेश, ने दूसरे बीजित खिलाड़ी जेवरेव को पहले राउंड में हराया है।", "उन्हें फिर से जेवरेव और अपने पिछले राउंड के विपक्षी नोस्कोवा के साथ सेमीफाइनल्स में देखने को मिलेगा।", "टूर्नामेंट में कई आश्चर्यजनक पराजित हुए हैं, जिसमें फेरी भी शामिल हैं।", "फेरी का सफलता ने टेनिस प्रशंसकों और विश्लेषकों से दुनिया भर में ध्यान आकर्षित किया है।", "विम्बलडन टूर्नामेंट आगे चल रहे सेमीफाइनल्स के साथ जारी है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets collectively emphasize Fery's underdog story and the surprise nature of his wins, highlighting the tournament's unpredictability. They also focus on the British wild card's fairytale run and the attention he is receiving from tennis fans worldwide.", "center": "Centrist coverage frames the story as a sports event, focusing on Fery's achievements and the tournament's progression. They mention the upsets but do not emphasize the surprise or underdog aspect of his wins."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वामपंथी सूत्रों द्वारा फेरी के नीचे खिलाड़ी और टूर्नामेंट में आश्चर्यजनक पराजितों को जोर दिया गया है, टूर्नामेंट की अनिश्चितता को उजागर करते हुए। वे ब्रिटिश वाइल्डकार्ड के पौराणिक रन और टेनिस प्रशंसकों से दुनिया भर में ध्यान आकर्षित करने पर भी जोर देते हैं।", "center": "केंद्रीय कवरेज फेरी की उपलब्धियों और टूर्नामेंट के आगमन पर ध्यान केंद्रित करता है, लेकिन आश्चर्य या नीचे खिलाड़ी के विजेत्व को उजागर नहीं करता।"}, "topic": "Sports", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/hy25gx/article71199809.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/Britain_Wimbledon_Tennis_39592.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/sport/wimbledon-ruthless-kostyuk-packs-off-paolini-sets-up-last-four-clash-with-noskova/article71199797.ece", "headline": "Ruthless Kostyuk packs off Paolini, sets up last-four clash with Noskova"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Who is Arthur Fery? The British wild card taking Wimbledon by storm"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2026/7/8/wildcard-fery-faces-zverev-in-wimbledon-semis-as-kostyuk-meets-noskova?traffic_source=rss", "headline": "Wildcard Fery faces Zverev in Wimbledon semis, as Kostyuk meets Noskova"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/tennis/top-stories/wimbledon-arthur-ferys-fairytale-makes-history-as-hometown-hero-joins-goran-ivanisevic-in-exclusive-wild-card-club/articleshow/132275631.cms", "headline": "Hometown hero Fery makes Wimbledon history as second wild card ever to reach semis"}, {"source": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Wildcard Fery faces Zverev in Wimbledon 